'''Blue Lagoon''' (南国諸島, ''Nangoku Shotō'', '''Southern Island Nations''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

